[20.352479, "o", "draft #2  pending  email  by agent (openrouter:anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5)\r\norg: Lantern Hill Winery   to: Priya Ramanathan <events@example.com>\r\nsubject: Following up on the summer patio series\r\n\r\nHi Priya, I'm following up on my October 31 note about playing the Lantern Hill patio series, May through September. I know you book for the summer over the winter, so I wanted to get on your radar early. Would you be open to telling me whether the series is still booking acts this year, or whether there's a better person to send a short intro to? Thanks for your time, and I hope to hear from you.\r\n"]
